 * zimmProductCardMedia/index.test.tsx's "Fix 1" block and
 * zimmProductCardContent/index.test.tsx's own real-recipe block. The component-level tests above
 * all render through the flat mock at the top of this file, which cannot see whether the real
 * recipe ever regresses the hover-reveal media query, the stretched-link overlay, or the z-index
